meaning:
Fresher than a mannequin implies that Future always has on the newest and most advertised clothes, as shops generally use mannequin’s to display their newest or most expensive items for sale in the windows.

The term has been used in Future’s song, “My Savages” when he says;

I’m always dressing fresher than a mannequin

Future is thrown off lean (Codeine + Sprite) which he’s taking with a variety of painkillers, including Percocet and Vicodin which are very powerful. Future has expressed how he uses drugs to unwind, such as in these following lines;

Take all my problems and drink out the bottle and fuck on a model, yeah

It seems like as is implied on “Codeine Crazy”, Future is taking all these drugs in order to escape from the problems that pervade his life.

An obvious allusion the the old tongue twister, Peter Piper:

Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled peppers;
A peck of pickled peppers Peter Piper picked;
If Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled peppers,
Where’s the peck of pickled peppers Peter Piper picked?
